quare tablet-remain move-2 hide-on-mobile"></div><div id="w-node-_3ee59811-b796-9037-8b41-99c75ed5c9d3-49e3ad4b" class="hero-square tablet-remain move-2 hide-on-mobile"></div><div id="w-node-_3ee59811-b796-9037-8b41-99c75ed5c9d4-49e3ad4b" style="opacity:0;-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 125%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 125%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 125%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 125%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" class="hero-square tablet-remain hide-on-mobile move-6"></div><div id="w-node-_3ee59811-b796-9037-8b41-99c75ed5c9d5-49e3ad4b" class="hero-illo-overlay"></div></div><div class="container header-container max-width-none"><div class="homepage-hero-content"><h1 class="text-color-white z-index-2">A different kind of stock exchange</h1><p class="paragraph-jumbo z-index-2">IEX Exchange facilitates the trading of U.S. equities, combining a transparent business model with innovative design and technology.</p><div class="coupler"><div class="coupler-inner"><div style="opacity:0" class="coupler-square is-first"><div class="coupler-square-glow"></div><div class="coupler-square-inner"></div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="coupler-square is-second"><div class="coupler-square-glow"></div><div class="coupler-square-inner"></div></div><div class="coupler-line"><div style="width:100%;height:0%" class="coupler-line-inner"></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section><div class="container header-container max-width-none"><div data-w-id="aac3db51-c927-eaac-58e5-0c64ac6ae1e8" class="layer-section-inner"><div class="max-width-1202"><h2 class="heading-3">Innovating to drive trading performance</h2><p class="paragraph-jumbo">We are focused on performance: driving superior execution quality for broker-dealers and investors with game-changing technology, data, experience, and expertise.</p><div class="button-wrap"><a href="/about" class="box-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-glow"></div><div class="secondary-button-block orange-button">About IEX</div><div class="secondary-button-block orange-button button-arrow"><div class="button-arrow-svg w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16.5 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.4971 7.98915L9.00846 15.4778L7.59425 14.0636L12.6687 8.98915L9.16569e-06 8.98915L9.25311e-06 6.98915L12.6687 6.98915L7.59425 1.9147L9.00846 0.500488L16.4971 7.98915Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><main><section class="section-15"><div class="tech-component-lottie-wrap"><div data-preserve-aspect-ratio="xMidYMid slice" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="tech-component-lottie-image" data-w-id="4e34eb79-187a-34b5-f908-3f268b0d1b5c" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/635ad1b3d188c13ccc1ebcad/637bc161a64e0058f8da59f2_Speed%20Bump%20%E2%80%93%202.4.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="18" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div></div><div data-w-id="4e34eb79-187a-34b5-f908-3f268b0d1b5d" class="container header-container max-width-none"><div><div data-w-id="4e34eb79-187a-34b5-f908-3f268b0d1b5f" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="tech-lottie-mobile-ph" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/635ad1b3d188c13ccc1ebcad/639cbe77ead5bf29a667ebbc_Speed%20Bump%20Mobile%20%E2%80%93%201.4.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="10" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="tech-component-content"><div class="overline yellow">Our Technology</div><h2 class="margin-bottom-24">The Speed Bump</h2><p class="paragraph-large-2">38 miles of coiled cable that incoming orders and messages must traverse before arriving at the exchange’s matching engine. <br/><br/>Creating a level playing field where the exchange can be a fair referee for trading.</p><a href="/technology#speed-bump" data-wf--glow-button--variant="base" class="box-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-glow"></div><div class="secondary-button-block">Learn More</div><div class="secondary-button-block button-arrow is-black"><div class="button-arrow-svg w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16.5 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.4971 7.98915L9.00846 15.4778L7.59425 14.0636L12.6687 8.98915L9.16569e-06 8.98915L9.25311e-06 6.98915L12.6687 6.98915L7.59425 1.9147L9.00846 0.500488L16.4971 7.98915Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div></div><div class="tablet-tech-spacing"><div data-w-id="4e34eb79-187a-34b5-f908-3f268b0d1b72" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="tech-lottie-mobile-ph" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/635ad1b3d188c13ccc1ebcad/637bfb4dcf7ee3cedfec9d8f_Signal%20Mobile%20%E2%80%93%201.3.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="8.333333333333334" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div><div class="tech-component-content move-right"><div class="overline yellow">Our Technology</div><h2 class="margin-bottom-24">The Signal</h2><p class="paragraph-large-2">A mathematical formula developed with machine learning. The Signal is built to identify moments when a stock’s price is unstable and is incorporated into a number of order types that are designed to protect orders while the price is changing.</p><div class="button-wrap"><a href="/technology#signal" data-wf--glow-button--variant="base" class="box-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-glow"></div><div class="secondary-button-block">Learn More</div><div class="secondary-button-block button-arrow is-black"><div class="button-arrow-svg w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16.5 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.4971 7.98915L9.00846 15.4778L7.59425 14.0636L12.6687 8.98915L9.16569e-06 8.98915L9.25311e-06 6.98915L12.6687 6.98915L7.59425 1.9147L9.00846 0.500488L16.4971 7.98915Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-15 padding-bottom padding-top-0"><div class="container header-container max-width-none"><a href="#" class="display-block w-inline-block w-lightbox"><img width="1464" height="400" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/696f8ac812dcabe749e3aa8c/69e7a4377ef2c79fd7cb6300_Midpoint%20Stability%20by%20Exchange_2.svg" loading="lazy" class="chart-image padding-bottom-96"/><script type="application/json" class="w-json">{
